## Context & External APIs
- This backend interfaces with Claude using the `anthropic` Ruby gem.
- For all SDK implementation syntax, payload structures, and error classes, rely on the official SDK documentation reference: 
  [Anthropic Ruby SDK Docs](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/cli-sdks-libraries/sdks/ruby)
- CRITICAL: When writing tool calling or structured schemas, strictly use the gem's native `Anthropic::BaseModel` and `Anthropic::BaseTool` DSL as defined in the reference link. Do not guess parameter patterns.
